('N4-L-POINT-020-D1', 'N4-L-POINT-020', 1, '週末のお祭りは楽しかったですか。', '[{"start":3,"end":6,"answer":"おまつり","accept":["お祭り"]},{"start":7,"end":12,"answer":"たのしかった","accept":["楽しかった","たのしかった"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-POINT-020-d1.mp3', '1254a5da3f270c209890d3423b8ebc40e0ef3126fbe761f569731d370960c004', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'fa0d79feb353'),
('N4-L-POINT-020-D2', 'N4-L-POINT-020', 2, '三枚撮った後は、カメラをかばんにしまいました。', '[{"start":8,"end":11,"answer":"カメラ","accept":["カメラ"]},{"start":12,"end":15,"answer":"かばん","accept":["かばん"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-POINT-020-d2.mp3', '775e7bd1e5e474aad5de89f8bb8f1e7250d570af480c5af49b8e13326fe06cfe', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'fa0d79feb353'),
