('N4-L-UTTERANCE-001-D1', 'N4-L-UTTERANCE-001', 1, 'この本をもう一週間借りてもいいですか。', '[{"start":0,"end":3,"answer":"このほん","accept":["この本"]},{"start":13,"end":18,"answer":"いいですか","accept":["いいですか"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-UTTERANCE-001-d1.mp3', 'bb3c472ef0af390af1a63430fef26110879f27fe8be8d3b5d0b0466a901672bc', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'fa0d79feb353'),
