('N4-L-UTTERANCE-008-D1', 'N4-L-UTTERANCE-008', 1, 'スプーンを持ってきていただけませんか。', '[{"start":0,"end":4,"answer":"スプーン","accept":["スプーン"]},{"start":5,"end":8,"answer":"もって","accept":["持って"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-UTTERANCE-008-d1.mp3', 'd68454ac29d5c74030416927a8e5470e9a0e5e33944d09bd8c5b32e3dee5ff40', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'fa0d79feb353'),
('N4-L-UTTERANCE-009-D1', 'N4-L-UTTERANCE-009', 1, '午後、荷物を箱に入れるのを手伝おうか。', '[{"start":0,"end":2,"answer":"ごご","accept":["午後","ごご"]},{"start":8,"end":11,"answer":"いれる","accept":["入れる"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-UTTERANCE-009-d1.mp3', 'a1d91dd05ec32fbe57d0b38920743483d2de96e24ec887b944d41da5e2925d78', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'fa0d79feb353'),
