('N4-L-UTTERANCE-011-D1', 'N4-L-UTTERANCE-011', 1, '私も写っているその写真を送ってくれない？', '[{"start":9,"end":11,"answer":"しゃしん","accept":["写真","しゃしん"]},{"start":12,"end":15,"answer":"おくって","accept":["送って"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-UTTERANCE-011-d1.mp3', '95e3beaaa8f2a6306c2dd59faeeb801cfaa2bed173c5099071e480aa919c20f3', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, 'fa0d79feb353'),
